{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791059580, "covers_from": "2026-10-03T20:33:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-03T20:34:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791059640, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-03T20:33:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 34079, "sprite_key": "turtle_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "醫療", "content": "我的暱稱是「老有所終，壯有所用，幼有所長」，例如中興醫院與臺大醫院配對，設好機制及給民眾誘因", "display_name": "松山代表 Jay", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-03T20:33:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 10366, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "未來市長，可以解決臺北橋機車引道塞車的問題嗎？", "display_name": "中山代表 Andy Yang", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-03T20:33:23+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 1891, "sprite_key": "penguin_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "育兒", "content": "想要孩子健康開心長大\n更多友善育兒空間\n有趣好玩的遊樂場", "display_name": "信義代表 No.1,891", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-03T20:33:32+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 25968, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "我要公共垃圾桶！！！\n出門逛街找半天沒垃圾桶能丟，傻眼ㄟ", "display_name": "松山代表 No.25,968", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-03T20:33:41+00:00", "duration_seconds": 19, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 53486, "sprite_key": "deer_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "體育", "content": "我就想問到底南港跟內湖地區有沒有辦法生出一塊標準的11人制人工足球場，港湖地區一塊人工足球場都沒有", "display_name": "內湖代表 祐樂", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 10366, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "中山代表 Andy Yang", "district": "zhongshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 1891, "sprite_key": "penguin_business", "display_name": "信義代表 No.1,891", "district": "xinyi", "is_replay": true, "fro